                        "args": {
                          "text": [
                            "Survey: The west\nservice bridge\nbears parcels, not\nmachinery. The\neast stair bears a",
                            "hand cart. Heavy\nregulator parts\nmust travel by\ndepot gate. Nib\nasks whether",
                            "describing the\nbridge as intimate\nwould help. Rivet\nanswers without\nlooking up."
                          ],
